plugins/htmlify/ is a vendored copy, not the source.

skills/htmlify/ is copied verbatim from the htmlify
repository at the tag recorded in meta/htmlify.skill.yml.
The copy is a whole package, not one file: SKILL.md, the
scripts it runs, and the agent metadata each client reads.
LICENSE beside this file is that repository's licence,
carried along because MIT requires the notice to travel with
a substantial copy.

    Upstream   https://github.com/trycopilotai/htmlify
    Copyright  (c) 2026 Pramod Kotipalli
    Licence    MIT

Do not edit anything under this directory. `make validate`
compares the whole vendored tree against the deterministic
digest recorded in meta/ and fails on any difference, and
`make sync` replaces the tree from upstream. Changes belong
in the upstream repository; issues and releases live there
too.
